Package: com.makr.icontint
Name: IconTint
Version: 1.0.1
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Dark and Tinted app icons in the iOS 18 style (own rendering engine, no Apple code) [vibe-coded]
 ⚠️ Vibe-coded: written almost entirely by an AI assistant (Claude); not audited, may crash SpringBoard or cause Safe Mode. Use at your own risk.
 ⚠️ Вайбкод: написано почти целиком ИИ-ассистентом (Claude), не аудировано, возможны вылеты SpringBoard и Safe Mode. На свой страх и риск.
Maintainer: makr
Author: makr
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate, preferenceloader, firmware (>= 15.0)
